---
title: Custom Dashboard Views Sequence Diagram
author: Project Sentinel
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Pro User (Dashboard)
    participant Backend as Sentinel Backend API

    User-->>Backend: Save custom dashboard layout
    Backend-->>User: Confirm layout saved
    User-->>Backend: Load custom dashboard layout
    Backend-->>User: Return saved layout
    User-->>User: View personalized dashboard
